?- { X != a }, same(X, b).
X = b
?- { X != a }, same(X, a).
false
?- { X != Y }, same(X, f(Z)), same(Y, f(W)).
X = f(Z), Y = f(W), Z != W
?- { X != Y }, same(X, f(Z)), same(Y, f(W)), same(Z, W).
false
?- { f(X, b) != f(a, Y) }, same(X, a).
